WEBVTT

00:05:27.796 --> 00:05:30.396
We are at the risk of losing all of that

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:33.956
for something we contributed
very, very little to.

00:05:35.116 --> 00:05:40.156
Raising and expanding the islands
is something my country is thinking of.

00:05:40.956 --> 00:05:44.716
However, we don’t have the resources
nor the infrastructure.

00:05:46.196 --> 00:05:48.076
Regardless,

00:05:48.076 --> 00:05:49.276
we remain adamant.

00:05:50.556 --> 00:05:53.316
We continue to fight for our livelihoods

00:05:53.316 --> 00:05:55.956
and not abandon our home.

00:05:57.356 --> 00:05:58.396
Thank you.

00:05:59.196 --> 00:06:00.836
(Marshallese) Komool tata.